summary:
  collectionName: Swagger Petstore - OpenAPI 3.0
  requests: 19
  folders: 3
  environments: 1
  baseUrl: /api/v3
  secretsToFill:
  - api_key
  warnings:
  - >-
    The spec defines 2 security schemes but no default; set the collection's auth
    by hand if needed.
  - >-
    The server URL "/api/v3" is relative; add the host to baseUrl in the default
    environment.
  - >-
    Security scheme "petstore_auth" only has the implicit OAuth2 flow, which Frida
    doesn't support; it was skipped.
  - GET /pet/{petId} allows several security alternatives; the first one was used.
  - "POST /pet/{petId}/uploadImage: the application/octet-stream body needs a file; choose it in the Body tab."
